nt-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">This game can be played indoors or outdoors. </span></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "b6Nw1Stf4C664KZ26qnnU", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 365562127, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2316, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": true, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<ol>\n<li>Ask your child to throw the balls into the circle. It doesn’t matter if they miss.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Once they have thrown all of them, ask them:</li>\n<ul>\n<li>How many balls landed in the circle?</li>\n<li>How many balls landed outside the circle?</li>\n<li>How many balls are there altogether?</li>\n</ul>\n<li>Repeat the activity to help your child learn the numbers within nine.</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "pU_IB75-vdjPnwCXRJyHZ", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 365562109, "text": "879369156", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details